### Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/health

### Daftar Menu
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus

### Daftar Menu - Filter Kategori
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus?category=Kopi

### Daftar Menu - Pencarian
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus?q=lost%20sheep

### Daftar Menu - Featured
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus?featured=true

### Kategori Menu
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus/categories

### Detail Menu (ganti UUID)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/menus/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Daftar Event Mendatang
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/events

### Daftar Event Sudah Berlalu
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/events?scope=past

### Semua Event
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/events?scope=all

### Detail Event (ganti UUID)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Chat
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "test_session_001",
  "message": "menu kopi apa saja?"
}

### Pesan via WhatsApp (ganti menu_id dengan UUID valid)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/orders/whatsapp-link
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "menu_id": "UUID_MENU_1", "quantity": 2, "variant": "Iced" },
    { "menu_id": "UUID_MENU_2", "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "note": "Tidak pakai gula"
}

### Login Admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "himar@admin.com",
  "password": "andrebaiksekali"
}

### Refresh Token (ganti dengan token valid)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Info Admin (ganti token)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin: Tambah Menu (ganti token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/menus
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espresso",
  "description": "Espresso klasik",
  "price": 18000,
  "category": "Kopi",
  "variants": [
    { "name": "Hot", "extra_price": 0 },
    { "name": "Iced", "extra_price": 3000 }
  ],
  "is_featured": false,
  "is_available": true
}

### Admin: Ubah Menu (ganti UUID dan token)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/menus/UUID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espresso Updated",
  "price": 20000,
  "category": "Kopi"
}

### Admin: Hapus Menu (ganti UUID dan token)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/menus/UUID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin: Tambah Event (ganti token)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/events
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Live Music Friday",
  "description": "Penampilan akustik setiap Jumat malam",
  "event_date": "2025-02-14T19:00:00+07:00",
  "location": "Indoor Stage",
  "is_published": true
}

### Admin: Semua Event (termasuk draft)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/events
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin: Ubah Event (ganti UUID dan token)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/events/UUID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Live Music Saturday",
  "event_date": "2025-02-15T19:00:00+07:00"
}

### Admin: Hapus Event (ganti UUID dan token)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/events/UUID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin: Upload Gambar (gunakan form-data, bukan JSON)
# POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/uploads
# Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----
# file: (pilih file gambar)
# folder: menus

### Admin: Riwayat Chat
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/chat-logs?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin: Riwayat Chat - Filter Intent
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/chat-logs?intent=tanya_menu
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
